      "q": "4. Create your own number pattern using the rule \u201cmultiply by 2 and subtract 1,\u201d starting with the number 3. Write the first five terms.\nAnswer:\n3, 5, 9, 17, 33.\n(Rule: Multiply by 2, then subtract 1.)",
      "a": "Detailed solution available."
