      "q": "1. You start from Floor +2 and press \u20133 in the lift. Where will you reach? Write an expression for this movement.",
      "a": "You start from Floor +2 and press -3 in the lift. Where will you reach? Write an expression for this movement.\nStarting floor: +2\nMovement: -3\nExpression: +2 + (-3)\nAnswer: +2 + (-3) = -1\nYou will reach Floor -1."
